      378.61,
      537.96,
      449.68
    ],
    "text": "I, Dayasiri Jayasekera, the Minister of Sports by virtue of powers vested in me under Sections 32(b) and 33 of the SportsAct, No. 25 of 1973 do hereby suspend with immediate effect, the registration of the Sri Lanka Judo Association whichis the National Association for Judo and as a interim arrangement, appoint Mr. Samasundara Ekanayake RajawardeneTennakoon Mudiyanselage Saman Priyantha Bandara, Director General of the Department of Sports Development ascompetent authority with effect from 30.08.2017 to continue its functions and further order that the election be convenedand held to elect new office bearers to the Sri Lanka Judo Association.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
